# 0236 = 0235 + QIESR0 enable fix.  ruby_ep2_config wrote QIESR0 with
#   TX-done alone, replacing the probe mask: EP1 RX-done never fired, so
#   GPD re-arm lagged (console: rxpk=19 rxdone=3) and the RX queue stopped.
#   OR in TX and both RX done bits instead.
